1
00:00:00,176 --> 00:00:02,806
As you saw, Claude Cowork is not Claude

2
00:00:02,918 --> 00:00:03,303
Chat.

3
00:00:03,944 --> 00:00:07,521
It plans and executes, so you have to tell

4
00:00:07,569 --> 00:00:10,856
