00:01:33,261 --> 00:01:36,103
2 options. In the AI chat world,

40
00:01:36,713 --> 00:01:38,287
the task would look something like this.

41
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,792
Look at each file in the folder. For each

42
00:01:40,888 --> 00:01:43,457
file, check the file type. If it's a PDF, do

