00:01:43,457 --> 00:01:46,572
this. If it's an image, do that, and so on.

44
00:01:47,327 --> 00:01:49,173
This would also work for this simple

45
00:01:49,173 --> 00:01:51,357
example, but it's not the way

46
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:54,536
it is recommended to use Claude Cowork. This

47
00:01:54,536 --> 00:01:57,701
is a task-oriented prompt, so to say, do

48
00:01:57,750 --> 00:01:59,935
this, do this, do that. So step-by-step

49
00:01:59,935 --> 00:02:02,136
instructions what the AI should do.

50
00:02:03,068 --> 00:02:05,285
Now, the better way is when you're working

51
00:02:05,317 --> 00:02:06,024
with Cowork

52
00:02:06,586 --> 00:02:07,101
is the

53
00:02:07,872 --> 00:02:09,607
outcome-based approach again.

54
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:11,390
So I just tell

55
00:02:12,049 --> 00:02:14,379
Cowork the result I want to have. So

56
00:02:14,459 --> 00:02:16,676
organize all files in this folder into

57
00:02:16,709 --> 00:02:19,135
subfolders by file type and then give me a

58
00:02:19,135 --> 00:02:21,286
