61
00:02:27,378 --> 00:02:29,318
you have to find out the steps, the required

62
00:02:29,318 --> 00:02:31,946
steps, how to do it and what makes most

63
00:02:31,946 --> 00:02:32,283
sense.

64
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,714
So if we do this, Cowork starts planning and

65
00:02:35,890 --> 00:02:36,339
thinking.

66
00:02:37,669 --> 00:02:40,026
It now even creates a script which you can

67
00:02:40,122 --> 00:02:42,158
