69
00:02:44,947 --> 00:02:47,143
And now it asks us for permission.

70
00:02:47,896 --> 00:02:49,932
Because first we cannot check the plan. So

71
00:02:49,996 --> 00:02:52,641
it tells us it sees 8 files, and now it

