76
00:03:02,724 --> 00:03:02,900
on.

77
00:03:04,327 --> 00:03:06,876
Now we can either proceed or redirect

78
00:03:06,892 --> 00:03:09,601
Cowork. So we can instruct it to approach

79
00:03:09,697 --> 00:03:10,531
