84
00:03:20,135 --> 00:03:22,621
And now it finally completes the task.

85
00:03:23,166 --> 00:03:24,882
And that's the whole idea behind this

86
00:03:24,946 --> 00:03:28,202
agentic approach. You instruct it for an

87
00:03:28,298 --> 00:03:30,928
outcome you want to have. It sets up a plan,

88
00:03:31,185 --> 00:03:34,056
it writes code, it asks you if this is the

