91
00:03:38,338 --> 00:03:40,518
And then it just fulfills your tasks. Even

92
00:03:40,582 --> 00:03:42,361
if it would get stuck, you don't have to

93
00:03:42,425 --> 00:03:45,150
redirect it. It will find out other ways to

94
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:47,105
