98
00:03:53,002 --> 00:03:55,886
differences between the chat and the cowork

99
00:03:55,886 --> 00:03:57,168
approach with AI.

100
00:03:58,530 --> 00:03:59,924
And now in our folder,

101
00:04:00,998 --> 00:04:03,658
